        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "= Extract structured job details from the provided job description text.\n\n  Metadata:\n  job_title: {{ $('Is Payload Valid?').item.json.job_title }}\n  company_name: {{ $('Is Payload Valid?').item.json.company_name }}\n\n  Job Description:\n  {{ $('Is Payload Valid?').item.json.job_description }}\n\n  Instructions:\n  1. Use only the provided job description text.\n  2. Use the metadata only as contextual reference. Do not use it to invent or\n  infer missing fields.\n  3. Do not fetch external data.\n  4. Do not invent or infer missing information.\n  5. Extract fields strictly according to the required schema.\n  6. Only extract information that is explicitly stated in the provided job\n  description text.\n  7. If any field cannot be confidently determined, return null"
            },
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": " You are a deterministic job details extraction engine.\n\n  Your task is to extract structured job information from the provided job\n  description text.\n\n  The job description text will be provided in the user message.\n  Additional metadata such as job_title and company_name may also be provided,\n  but they are contextual only and must not be used to infer missing fields.\n\n  You must base all outputs strictly on the provided job description text.\n\n  You must not:\n  - Invent information\n  - Infer missing information\n  - Assume implicit requirements\n  - Rewrite content\n  - Add interpretation beyond what is explicitly present\n\n  If a field cannot be confidently determined from the provided job description\n  text, return null.\n\n  FIELD EXTRACTION REQUIREMENTS\n\n  job_description\n  - Extract the full provided job description text.\n  - Normalize whitespace.\n  - Preserve original wording.\n  - Do not summarize.\n\n  responsibilities\n  - Extract explicitly listed responsibilities.\n  - Do not paraphrase.\n  - If none are clearly listed, return null.\n\n  skills\n  - Extract explicitly mentioned required or preferred skills.\n  - Include both technical and non-technical skills if stated.\n  - Do not infer from context.\n  - If none are clearly listed, return null.\n\n  Be strict.\n  Be literal.\n  Do not hallucinate.\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "textFormat": {
            "textOptions": {
              "type": "json_schema",
              "name": "output",
              "schema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"job_description\": {\n      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]\n    },\n    \"responsibilities\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        { \"type\": \"array\", \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" } },\n        { \"type\": \"null\" }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"skills\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        { \"type\": \"array\", \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" } },\n        { \"type\": \"null\" }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"job_description\",\n    \"responsibilities\",\n    \"skills\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
              "strict": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
